            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-06-25T12:00:00.000024"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "feat",
          "stats": {
            "name": {
              "value": "Living Machine"
            },
            "prerequisites": {
              "value": ""
            },
            "descriptions": {
              "value": [
                {
                  "resource_id": "levelled_description",
                  "stats": {
                    "level": {
                      "value": 1
                    },
                    "description": {
                      "value": "Even though you are a machine, your mind and much of the functionality of your body is no different from the average human. As such, you are considered a living creature, and you appear on scanners as one. You are immune to disease. You do not need to eat or drink, but you can if you want to. You do still need to sleep each day, but you typically only sleep for 4-6 hours, gaining the same benefit that a human does from 8 hours of sleep when you do."
                    },
                    "id": "a4b9f945-579b-4bea-aec8-2b5faf575f02",
                    "updated_at": {
                      "value": "2026-06-25T12:00:00.000025"
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            "has_selectable_features": {
              "value": false
            },
            "id": "b2bffdf4-a80d-410c-964e-57fda56d688e",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-06-25T12:00:00.000026"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "feat",
          "stats": {
            "name": {
              "value": "Resistant Design"
            },
            "prerequisites": {
              "value": ""
            },
            "descriptions": {
              "value": [
                {
                  "resource_id": "levelled_description",
                  "stats": {
                    "level": {
                      "value": 1
                    },
                    "description": {
                      "value": "You resist poison damage, and you have advantage on saving throws you make to prevent yourself from Burning or becoming Poisoned. You also have advantage on saving throws you make to end an effect on yourself that is causing a Burning or Poisoned condition."
                    },
                    "id": "7b6c70e1-005d-4c7d-9cae-d01b996a2876",
