                            "description": {
                              "value": "If you make an attack roll, saving throw, or ability check that fails, you can choose to add a bonus to your attack roll, saving throw, or ability check that is equal to the number of creatures who can see you and that you are aware of (maximum bonus of +5). If using this trait causes you to succeed on your attack roll, ability check, or saving throw, you cannot use this trait again until you complete a short or long rest."
